# Add module to unified pipelines (do not copy per-module YAML files).

## 1. scanners-build.yml — add matrix row:
```yaml
        s3:
          moduleName: s3
```

## 2. scanners-ops.yml — add to parameters.scanner.values:
```yaml
      - s3
```

Task family and EventBridge rule are auto-derived from `namePrefix` in the variable group.
